<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="cs">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Soupis otevřených položek</title>
<style>
    /* mPDF kvirky: single class names, žádné nested selectory, padding v <td> ne v <div> */
    body { font-family: montserrat, dejavusans, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; color: #15131D; }
    .header-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 3mm; }
    .header-table td { vertical-align: top; }
    .header-meta { font-size: 8pt; color: #555; }
    .header-title { font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; padding: 0 6mm; }
    .header-period { text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 2mm; }
    .note { font-size: 7pt; color: #555; margin-bottom: 3mm; }
    .account-title { font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; margin: 3mm 0 1mm 0; }
    .mismatch { color: #b91c1c; font-weight: bold; }
    .unusual { color: #b91c1c; }
    table.book { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0; }
    table.book thead th { font-size: 7pt; font-weight: normal; color: #555; text-align: right; padding: 1mm 1.5mm; border-bottom: 0.3pt solid #ccc; }
    table.book thead th.thl { text-align: left; }
    table.book tbody td { padding: 0.8mm 1.5mm; font-size: 8pt; border-bottom: 0.2pt solid #eee; vertical-align: top; }
    table.book tfoot td { font-weight: bold; padding: 1.5mm; border-top: 0.5pt solid #333; }
    .num { text-align: right; }
    .sign-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 12mm; }
    .sign-cell { width: 50%; font-size: 8pt; color: #555; padding-top: 8mm; border-top: 0.3pt solid #999; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<table class="header-table">
    <tr>
        <td style="width:30%;">
            <div class="header-meta">{{ entity.name }}</div>
            <div class="header-meta">IČO: {{ entity.ico }}</div>
            <div class="header-meta">{{ entity.address }}</div>
        </td>
        <td style="width:40%;">
            <div class="header-title">Soupis otevřených položek</div>
            <div class="header-period">k datu {{ as_of|cz_date }}</div>
        </td>
        <td style="width:30%;">
            <div class="header-meta">Sestaveno: {{ entity.prepared_at }}</div>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<div class="note">
    Podklad k inventarizaci účtů (§29–30 zákona č. 563/1991 Sb., o účetnictví). Součet otevřených částek každého účtu se porovnává se zůstatkem účtu k datu. Zůstatek je se znaménkem podle typu účtu.
</div>

{% if accounts is empty %}
    <p style="text-align:center; color:#888; padding: 10mm 0;">Vybrané účty nemají k datu žádný pohyb.</p>
{% endif %}

{% for acc in accounts %}
    <div class="account-title">{{ acc.account.code }} {{ acc.account.name }}</div>
    <table class="book">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th class="thl" style="width:9%;">Datum</th>
                <th class="thl" style="width:13%;">Doklad</th>
                <th class="thl" style="width:8%;">Účet</th>
                <th class="thl" style="width:30%;">Popis</th>
                <th class="thl" style="width:16%;">Partner</th>
                <th class="thl" style="width:8%;">Okruh</th>
                <th style="width:8%;">Otevřeno MD</th>
                <th style="width:8%;">Otevřeno Dal</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for item in acc.items %}
                <tr>
                    <td>{{ item.entry_date|cz_date }}</td>
                    <td>{{ item.document_no }}</td>
                    <td>{{ item.account_code }}</td>
                    <td>{{ item.description|slice(0, 60) }}</td>
                    <td>{{ item.partner|slice(0, 30) }}</td>
                    <td>{{ item.pairing_id ? '#' ~ item.pairing_id : '' }}</td>
                    <td class="num">{{ item.side == 'debit' ? item.open_amount|cz_money : '' }}</td>
                    <td class="num">{{ item.side == 'credit' ? item.open_amount|cz_money : '' }}</td>
                </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
        <tfoot>
            <tr>
                <td colspan="6">
                    Otevřených položek: {{ acc.open_count }} · zůstatek účtu:
                    <span class="{{ acc.balance_unusual ? 'unusual' : '' }}">{{ acc.balance_signed|cz_money }}</span>
                    {% if not acc.matches %}
                        · <span class="mismatch">rozdíl proti zůstatku {{ acc.difference|cz_money }}</span>
                    {% endif %}
                </td>
                <td class="num">{{ acc.open_md|cz_money }}</td>
                <td class="num">{{ acc.open_d|cz_money }}</td>
            </tr>
        </tfoot>
    </table>
{% endfor %}

<table class="sign-table">
    <tr>
        <td class="sign-cell">Sestavil (datum, podpis)</td>
        <td class="sign-cell">Schválil, odpovědná osoba (datum, podpis)</td>
    </tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>
